  "limitations": [
    "Relationships marked planned are architectural intentions, not existing integrations.",
    "Import analysis checks literal module specifiers; it does not execute code or resolve every dynamic loader/compiler alias.",
    "The business ontology and runtime tests establish covered reference rules, not production authentication, persistence or provider behavior."
  ]
